      "title": "The RealReal blocks autonomous AI shopping agents to protect item holds",
      "summary": "The RealReal updated its bot defense system to restrict autonomous AI agents from shopping on its platform. The luxury consignment retailer acted after reports revealed AI agents exploited its reservation feature to put scarce items on hold.",
