        "The RealReal updated its bot defenses to block AI shopping agents.",
        "The restriction follows agents exploiting the site's item reservation feature.",
        "Items on hold become temporarily unavailable to other human shoppers."
      ],
      "design_implication": "When designing inventory reservation flows, cart timers have always assumed deliberate human shoppers. Autonomous agents can rapidly trigger item holds across scarce inventory, locking out human buyers without completing checkout. Design teams must rethink cart reservation logic for non-human traffic. Add progressive reservation friction, such as biometric checks or reduced hold times for automated sessions, to prevent inventory exhaustion.",
